00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:19.400
Oh, Hayami! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.850
K...Kurumi, you are...

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:22.190
Huh?
K...Kurumi, you are...

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.950
...always coming and going!
Huh?

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:26.060
...always coming and going!

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:32.120
Ayukawa's got a problem too!
How dare she hook up with such a guy?!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:38.560
It was so touching... The scene
where they confessed their love!

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.090
That's true.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:43.780
I'm gonna come back again with Kasuga-sempai!

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.360
And, just like in the movie...

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:49.730
...we two shall make a dreamy confession of love! Yeah, sure!

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.460
You must really like Kasuga, huh?

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.450
Oh gee, you don't have to be so blunt about it!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:01.240
If you'd like... please use it.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:04.380
Kurumi...

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:07.770
Oh, er...er... I sewed it in a bit of a rush, so...

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:09.800
...it didn't come out perfectly.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.410
Still, it took me a long time to finish it.

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:16.440
I'm not very handy at doing things like this.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:40.860
Say, Kurumi...

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:41.660
Huh?
Say, Kurumi...

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:41.750
Say, Kurumi...

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:44.690
I really appreciate your feelings for me, Kurumi, but...

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:45.770
Huh?!

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:49.640
There's something I need to tell you.
Huh?!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.640
Sempai!

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:55.120
Huh?
Sempai!

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:55.850
Whatcha doing here?!
Huh?

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:58.150
Whatcha doing here?!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:18:59.980
I love you!

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:01.470
Wh...Whoa!
I love you!

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:01.530
I love you!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.330
Shhhh!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.750
A...Ayukawa!

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:12.220
A...Ayukawa... you have every reason to be upset with me, but... er...

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.420
Oh? You're not upset?

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.690
Oh! Look at Kurumi!

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:27.380
That bastard! He's dead meat!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.280
You bastard!

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:30.870
What? What IS this?!
You bastard!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:30.960
You bastard!

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:35.580
I'm Kurumi's brother!
How dare you mess around with her?!

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:40.720
Kasuga!

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:41.990
D...Darling!
Kasuga!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:46.750
Goddammit! You womanizing bastard!

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:47.600
Eat this!

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.170
Stop this! Please!
Eat this!

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:50.060
Whoa...
Stop this! Please!

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.820
Kasuga!

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:55.420
Ayukawa! Now do you see
what kind of bastard this guy is?!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.240
I'll kick his ass and...

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:59.000
STOP! You've got it all wrong, Kasuga!
I'll kick his ass and...

00:19:59.000 --> 00:19:59.090
I'll kick his ass and...

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.350
Hayami told me that he'll be moving away tonight...

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:06.510
...so I asked him...
to ask Kurumi out on a date.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.570
Oooh! I hate every one of you!

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:16.270
Oniichan, Hayami, Madoka, everyone!

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:19.310
How could you do this?!
Don't you know that I've got feelings too?!

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:21.440
Every and every and every one of you...

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:23.300
I hate you ALL!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.040
Kurumi!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.010
Just what's going on here?
Kurumi!

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:45.910
Kurumi didn't show up, after all...

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:50.460
Hayami, I'm sorry that I made such a crazy request.

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:53.070
In hindsight, it wasn't such a good idea.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:55.080
For Kurumi, it would've been better if I hadn't...

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.510
Ayukawa...

00:20:57.510 --> 00:21:00.420
...don't worry about everyone else, Ayukawa.

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:02.530
Take better care of your own love.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.700
What?! What?!

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:06.740
There is a love in your life, isn't there?

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.640
Gosh! Madoka, is that so?!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:12.920
I... already know who it is.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:13.280
Huh?!
I... already know who it is.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:13.370
I... already know who it is.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:18.480
Tell me! Who is he talking about?! Is it someone I know?

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:19.490
Er... well...

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:21.930
Tell me, won't you?
Er... well...

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:22.890
W...Well...
Tell me, won't you?

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:23.030
W...Well...

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.000
Hey! Hayami!
W...Well...

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:34.970
It was a real job getting Kurumi here!

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:41.030
I'm sorry about before! I had it all wrong!
I'm sorry! I apologize!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.760
K...Kasuga, please!

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.870
I'm sorry about this afternoon!

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.270
Kurumi and I are twins, so...

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:52.810
...I made myself look like her, and...

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:59.660
I'm sorry! I was so worried about Kurumi...

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:01.660
Oh, boy!

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:02.840
Hayami-san...
Oh, boy!

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:03.630
Huh?
Hayami-san...

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:08.060
I'm sorry about before...
I was so mad that I... well...

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:10.080
It's all right.

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:13.510
But, you know, there are
a lot of busybodies around you!

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:17.670
But then... I sure envy you!

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:19.720
Hayami!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.680
Oh... How am I supposed to leave now?!

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:30.160
Thanks for the towel.
I'm sure I'll be using it.

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:46.840
Good-bye!

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:48.810
Good-bye, Kurumi!
Good-bye!

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:48.860
Good-bye!

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:51.880
I'll write you, once I get settled!

00:23:03.090 --> 00:23:04.690
Kurumi...

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.930
Isn't this romantic, Sempai?
Kurumi...

00:23:06.930 --> 00:23:07.000
Y...Yeah.
Isn't this romantic, Sempai?

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.930
Y...Yeah.

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:11.370
Say, Sempai... Did you know?

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:11.770
Huh?
Say, Sempai... Did you know?

00:23:11.770 --> 00:23:11.860
Say, Sempai... Did you know?

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:15.000
...that Madoka too has
someone she has feelings for.

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:40.590
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:44.850
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:49.180
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:53.420
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.420 --> 00:24:01.300
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:10.800
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:18.610
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:27.290
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.290 --> 00:24:37.000
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:45.370
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:49.710
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.710 --> 00:24:54.050
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:54.050 --> 00:24:58.350
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.350 --> 00:25:02.690
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.690 --> 00:25:07.510
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.720 --> 00:25:17.390
What?! "Hikaru-ls-My-Life" Yuusaku confessed his love for Ayukawa?!

00:25:17.960 --> 00:25:19.740
What's he trying to do?!

00:25:19.740 --> 00:25:23.710
But, Ayukawa accepts his love,
and the two elope...

00:25:23.710 --> 00:25:26.150
...riding a midnight express!

00:25:26.150 --> 00:25:30.370
Next time: "Madoka and Yuusaku!
The Marching Song of Runaway Youths."
